msgid "Sticky Order"
msgstr "置顶排序"

msgid "All sticky posts"
msgstr "所有置顶文章"

msgid "No sticky posts yet. Check \"Sticky\" in the post editor and the post will appear here automatically."
msgstr "还没有置顶文章。在文章编辑页勾选「置顶」，文章会自动出现在这里。"

msgid "Drag the handle on the left to reorder. Posts at the top come first."
msgstr "拖动左侧手柄调整顺序，越靠上越靠前。"

msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "保存更改"

msgid "Order saved."
msgstr "顺序已保存。"

msgid "No featured image"
msgstr "无特色图片"

msgid "These sticky posts are not in any group and will not appear in any queue:"
msgstr "这些置顶文章不属于任何分组，也不会出现在任何队列里："

msgid "Assign them a category that matches a group."
msgstr "请为这些文章指定与分组对应的分类。"

msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "抱歉，您不能这么做。"

msgid "Position in its sticky queue, starting at 0; null when the post is not queued."
msgstr "在所属置顶队列中的位置，从 0 开始；文章不在队列中时为 null。"

msgid "Key of the queue the post belongs to; null when the post is not queued."
msgstr "文章所属队列的键名；文章不在队列中时为 null。"
